# Minimal fluxbox config for the Studio remote-desktop container: a single
# maximized app window, no need for multiple virtual desktops (scrolling the
# background can switch to an empty one, looking like a crash). Missing keys
# fall back to fluxbox's own defaults, same as if this file didn't exist.
#
# Deliberately NOT touching defaultDeco here: removing fluxbox's titlebar
# (NONE or BORDER) looked right in a screenshot, but local testing couldn't
# confirm clicks still reach the app afterwards — and this sandbox has no
# prior confirmed success clicking *inside* the VNC canvas at all, so that
# result isn't trustworthy either way. Not worth risking real interactivity
# over 3 unused titlebar buttons; the default (interactive, per real usage
# on the deployed instance) stays as-is.
session.screen0.workspaces: 1
